<p>Channel eldritch forces into a ferocious melee attack, hitting the target three times with your shields doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">104%, 123%, 137%, 149%, 160%</acronym> Nature damage.</p><p>If any of the attacks hit, the target will be dazed for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns and your Block cooldown is reset.</p><p>The chance for the attack to daze increases with you Physical Power, but it is considered a magical attack and thus is resisted with spell save, rather than physical save.</p>